     1290   if valid-handle( g#trdcalib ) <> yes then do:       run str/trdcalib.p persistent no-error.       if error-status :error or valid-handle( g#trdcalib ) <> yes then do:         message "Error starting trdcalib.p"    skip( 0 )                 g#trdcalib                     skip( 0 )                 g#trdcalib   :type             skip( 0 )                 g#trdcalib   :file-name        skip( 0 )                 error-status :get-message( 1 ) skip( 0 )                 return-value                   skip( 0 )         view-as alert-box error.         stop.       end.      end.     run trdcalib_tdat-val in g#trdcalib (  input p-torgconfdoc-code ,
     1291                           input 'ndovwho':U ,
     1292                          output p-torgconf-ndovwho ,
     1293                          output p-torgconf-ndovwho-type ) no-error .
     1294       if error-status :error then do:
     1295        message
     1296         vss-workfile vss-revision vss-description skip
     1297         "Ошибка при вызове процедуры tdat-val":U skip
     1298         "Документ: " p-torgconfdoc-code skip
     1299         "Атрибут: " 'ndovwho':U skip
     1300         "Значение: " p-torgconf-ndovwho skip
     1301         trim( error-status :get-message (1) ) skip
     1302         return-value skip
     1303         view-as alert-box error.
     1304       undo, return error return-value.
     1305       end.
     1306     end procedure.
